## Design System — tokens de référence

```css
/* COULEURS */
--teal:   #00E5CC; /* labels · logo · barres */
--violet: #7B4FE8; /* CTA primaire uniquement */
--green:  #39E075; /* barres progression */
--text:   #FFFFFF; /* toujours */
--text-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
--text-3: rgba(255,255,255,0.50);
--text-4: rgba(255,255,255,0.30);

/* GLASSMORPHISM */
--glass-nav:   rgba(4,8,18,0.55);
--glass-card:  rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
--glass-tag:   rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
--glass-modal: rgba(4,8,18,0.82);
--blur-nav:    blur(20px) saturate(160%);
--blur-card:   blur(40px) saturate(180%) brightness(105%);
--blur-modal:  blur(60px) saturate(200%);

/* OMBRES */
--shadow-sm:  0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
--shadow-md:  0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.20), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
--shadow-lg:  0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.28), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
--shadow-xl:  0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.35), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
--glow-teal:  0 0 24px rgba(0,229,204,0.25), 0 0 48px rgba(0,229,204,0.12);
--glow-violet:0 0 24px rgba(123,79,232,0.30), 0 0 48px rgba(123,79,232,0.15);

/* BORDER RADIUS */
--r-xs:6px; --r-sm:10px; --r-md:14px;
--r-lg:20px; --r-xl:28px; --r-pill:100px;

/* TYPOGRAPHIE */
--hero: clamp(52px,9vw,110px);
--h1:   clamp(36px,5vw,72px);
--h2:   clamp(24px,3vw,44px);
--h3:   clamp(18px,2vw,28px);
--body: 16px; --label: 11px;

/* ESPACEMENT */
--s1:8px; --s2:16px; --s3:24px; --s4:32px;
--s5:48px; --s6:64px; --s7:80px; --s8:120px; --s9:160px;

/* TIMING */
--t-micro:   80ms  cubic-bezier(0.25,0.1,0.25,1);
--t-hover:   200ms cubic-bezier(0.25,0.1,0.25,1);
--t-std:     300ms cubic-bezier(0.25,0.1,0.25,1);
--t-reveal:  600ms cubic-bezier(0.25,0.1,0.25,1);
--t-page:    500ms cubic-bezier(0.77,0,0.18,1);
--t-breathe: 4s ease-in-out infinite;
```

## Fond (mode-nuit / mode-jour)

```css
body.mode-nuit, body:not(.mode-jour) {
  background-image: url('/assets/images/bg-sombre.webp');
}
body.mode-jour {
  background-image: url('/assets/images/bg-clair.webp');
}
/* Overlay — NE PAS MODIFIER les valeurs */
body:not(.mode-jour)::before { background: rgba(4,8,18,0.38); }
body.mode-jour::before       { background: rgba(4,8,18,0.58); }
```

